OL,3,GNEWSAArchdiocese defends Catholic      
OL,4,Aschool academy plans                   
OL,6,FThe Archdiocese of Liverpool has       
OL,7,Fdefended plans to convert Catholic     
OL,8,Fschools into academies after parents,  
OL,9,Fteachers and union representatives     
OL,10,Fraised concerns at a public meeting.   
OL,12,FMore than 120 people attended the      
OL,13,Fmeeting at Liverpool's Liner Hotel on  
OL,14,FMonday to discuss the proposals, which 
OL,15,Fthe archdiocese said would help secure 
OL,16,Fthe future of Catholic education.      
OL,18,FThe National Education Union (NEU) said
OL,19,Fthe proposals were being imposed       
OL,20,Fwithout proper consultation.           
