OL,3,GNEWSAArchdiocese defends Catholic      
OL,4,Aschool academy plans                   
OL,6,FCanon Father Mike Fitzsimons, Episcopal
OL,7,FVicar for Education for the Archdiocese
OL,8,Fof Liverpool, said the plans had been  
OL,9,Fdeveloped over the past four years.    
